Parts derived from slackin-extended
-----------------------------------

The page's look and the badge are derived from slackin-extended
(https://github.com/emedvedev/slackin-extended; OONI's fork:
https://github.com/ooni/slackin-extended), Edward Medvedev's fork of slackin
(https://github.com/rauchg/slackin) by Guillermo Rauch. The slackin-extended
files they come from were written by Edward Medvedev and XhmikosR, with
changes by Aaron Gibson in OONI's fork:

- templates/layout.html, the styles: from scss/_common.scss and
  scss/_light.scss
- templates/layout.html and templates/index.html, the page's layout and
  wording: from views/main.pug
- assets/badge.svg: from views/badge-svg.pug

