slack.com serves it (https://a.slack-edge.com/1f40066/marketing/img/nav/logo.svg),
favicon-32.png copied from slackin-extended's assets. The logo and the Slack
trademark belong to Slack Technologies; they are used here only to show that
the page leads to Slack, and are under neither this repository's license nor
slackin-extended's.
